<title>JAPAN: Cabin Industrial acquires Uchida Yoko affiliate.</title>
<headline>Cabin Industrial acquires Uchida Yoko affiliate.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese projector maker Cabin Industrial Co Ltd said on Thursday that it had acquired an affiliate firm of Uchida Yoko Co Ltd.</p>
<p>A spokesman for Cabin Industrial said the company purchased Uchida Engineering KK, which manufactures and markets computer peripherals, for 30 million yen.</p>
<p>Uchida Engineering posted sales of 281 million yen in the year to July 1996, up from 225 million yen the previous year, Cabin Industrial said in a statement.</p>
</text>
